## X. Known Limitations & Future Work

| Limitation | Status |
|---|---|
| Single-variable FDI (level only) | Frozen scope — coordinated multi-sensor FDI is future work |
| Single-variable replay (level only) | Frozen scope — multi-variable replay is future work |
| Mutually exclusive attacks | Frozen scope — combined attacks (e.g., DoS+FDI) are future work |
| No compromised actuators | Frozen scope |
| Simple bang-bang controller | Sufficient for prototype; PID is future enhancement |
| No state estimator for Twin | Option B (per-scenario reinit) is sufficient; Kalman filter is future work |
| CPU-only LSTM training | GPU support via PyTorch is available if needed |
